<b><%= @group_event_count %> grouped vpsAdmin events</b>
<% @group_events.each do |event| -%>
- [<code><%= h(event.severity) %></code>] <%= h(event.subject) %> (<code><%= h(event.event_type) %></code>)
<% end -%>
<% if @group_truncated_count > 0 -%>
… and <%= @group_truncated_count %> more
<% end -%>
<% if @base_url.present? -%>

Link: <a href="<%= h("#{@base_url}?page=notifications&action=events") %>">events in vpsAdmin</a>
<% end -%>
